# public/models/*.glb are deliberately NOT ignored. They are build products of
# the Blender scripts, but regenerating them needs Blender 5.x on the machine,
# and the game cannot run without them. Committing the ~2MB of compressed .glb
# keeps the repo clone-and-play; `npm run assets` rebuilds them from source.
